  "description": "<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Every Barefoot Button includes the hardware needed for installation, but sometimes extra parts come in handy.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Whether you&#8217;re setting up additional buttons, replacing lost hardware, or keeping spare parts in your gig bag, this Replacement Set Screw &amp; Allen Wrench Kit makes it easy to keep your Barefoot Buttons ready to go.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Each kit includes replacement set screws and an Allen wrench for installation and adjustment. Simply select the set screw size that matches your Barefoot Buttons using the dropdown menu.</p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1d7mrtu\" data-start=\"597\" data-end=\"608\">Features</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">• Genuine Barefoot Buttons replacement hardware<br />\n• Great to keep as backup hardware for pedalboard maintenance<br />\n• Includes Allen wrench for installation and adjustment<br />\n• Available in multiple set screw sizes to match your Barefoot Buttons<br />\n• Compact and easy to store in a gig bag, toolbox, or pedalboard case</p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"14bu82z\" data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"885\">Compatibility</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Available for all Barefoot Button Fits.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Please select the correct size for your Barefoot Buttons before ordering.</p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1vgjuc7\" data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1024\">Why Players Keep Extras</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Set screws are small, and occasionally one goes missing during a pedalboard rebuild, switch replacement, or routine adjustments. Keeping a spare set on hand helps ensure you&#8217;re always ready to move, swap, or install your Barefoot Buttons without interruption.</p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"14bu82z\" data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"885\">Included</h2>\n<p>• Allen wrench<br />\n• Replacement set screws (6)</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
